  and 53 mapped Supercharger sites worldwide. Badge-to-site uncertainty is
  retained. The CC BY 4.0 license applies only to Lakshman Turlapati's original
  mappings, selection, and editorial text; see DATA-RIGHTS.md for exclusions.
